{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_glaze_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_glaze_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "聖城晚照",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_glaze_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1c6a7ef1ba4c460ab8331771f0a13662440d508376c8e25c3ec7e3c55e7127fa",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喔……同學們，下課鈴響了。我們的課程時間永遠是這麼短暫。\n雖然個別同學早在鈴響前就溜走了，還有的一直趴在桌上睡大覺，但是這並無不妥。\n……“與銃械交流”本身就是一門將會伴隨你們終身的課程。\n同學們啊，你們都已經拿到了屬於自己的那一把守護銃。\n但你們想清楚將要用它守護什麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "唔，我睡著了？……好吵啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "上司打來的電話……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……還是掛掉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "安比爾！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "怎麼了，隊長？我可是一直在堅守崗位喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "堅守崗位……？我跟你說過多少次了！戍衛隊就要有戍衛隊的樣子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "站好了！別躺在神聖的拉特蘭高牆上！你這麼喜歡躺著，怎麼不躺在聖徒像的懷裡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "真的可以躺在聖徒像的懷裡嗎——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "你……你少跟我嬉皮笑臉的！別忘了，我們守護的可是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "拉——特——蘭——的——榮——耀——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "哼，希望你能把這句話放在心裡……今天是你的最後機會了，再搞砸，你就滾出戍衛隊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一座哨塔。\n這是守城人安比爾被分配看守的地方。一面寬大的圍牆分隔了辦公街區與休閒街區，這裡屢次出現翻牆事件。\n她的工作很簡單，只是阻止人們翻越圍牆；她的工作也很困難，畢竟沒人能遏制住拉特蘭人那顆嚮往自由的心。\n守城人叼著巧克力，觀察著這座藍色與白色相疊交錯的聖城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "鐘樓一切正常，學校一切正常，辦公區也一切正常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "直到目前為止，都沒有什麼異常……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守城人在終端上草草地寫上幾句工作紀錄，便再次躺在大理石露台上，慵懶地望向那片雲天。\n她不只一次產生過這樣的感覺。\n這座聖城，這座平靜、安寧，又一成不變的聖城——\n真像是天空落在這片大地上的倒影啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……下班後，要去哪裡逛逛呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哎喲——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "好痛……是誰拿巧克力丟我？害我掉下來……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "這裡禁止通行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "你隨意翻越圍牆的行為，違反了街區管理法則，也擾亂了戍衛隊日常的防衛工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "但……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "順帶一提喔，我這只是例行公事，剛剛那句話也是複述我上司的原話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "如果有任何異議，你可以去戍衛隊抗議，也可以向公證所呈文申訴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "不過，要是你有正當理由，我也可以放你過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "正當理由……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "我現在確實要趕路……如果不從這裡翻牆走，我就要繞好大一圈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "你看到那邊的側門了嗎？它應該能幫你省去不少路程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "你只要等一會，等到下班時間，從那個門走過去就行囉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "這個理由駁回了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "等等……下班時間？那可不行，我肯定會錯過的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "錯過什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "……不行，我不能說……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "配合執行機密遺囑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "（搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "也對，你看起來也不像是執行者……那麼，協助運送重要物資？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "（搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "看來也不是信使……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "但、但是……和這些差不多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "反正……我要去做的，是對我來說非常關鍵的事，而且今天是唯一的機會！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "這麼誇張嗎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "對不起，我確實不能再耽誤時間了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敏捷的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "別、別追了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敏捷的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "可惡，應該要往哪裡跑……這邊好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的執行者",
      "text": "請你配合公證所的工作，不要再拒捕了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的執行者",
      "text": "咦……？岔路？他跑到哪邊去了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "（指左邊）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的執行者",
      "text": "喔，好！多謝你，小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "……那個，守城人小姐，請問可以放我走了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "等等，我有一個好主意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一條小巷。\n太陽正向西落，樓宇影子遮住街巷的半邊，是個打瞌睡的好地方。\n守城人捂緊了耳朵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "……守城人小姐，你想出來的辦法就是用炸藥把圍牆開個大洞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "是啊，怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "規定不准翻牆，又沒規定不准把牆開個洞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "還呆站著幹嘛，你不急著走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "……好！多謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "那麼，這位執行者先生，接下來就要請你幫忙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的執行者",
      "text": "沒問題，小事一樁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的執行者",
      "text": "……4月27日下午4點27分，位於帕尼拉大街與舒芙蕾大街交界處的一面圍牆完成合法爆破。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的執行者",
      "text": "已在公證所執行者里凱萊的見證下執行完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "戍衛隊狙擊手，安比爾，已確保爆破行為未威脅公民的生命財產安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "搞定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "謝謝囉，執行者先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "沒什麼，剛才也多虧了你，我才能抓到這傢伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被銬住的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "嗚……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "我也沒做什麼，就是指個方向嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "哈哈哈，別謙虛嘛，我知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "那根立柱是你用銃擊倒的，對不對？如果沒有你，這傢伙也不會被攔住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "這麼遠的距離……現在戍衛隊都要配備像你這麼厲害的狙擊手嗎？真是可怕啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "咦，這算是在誇我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "倒是你們這些空手就能解決問題的執行者才更可怕吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "在和平的拉特蘭，很難想像也會有你們不得不使用銃械的情形。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "哈哈哈，要是不用銃械，怎樣才能在甜品店射擊比賽裡贏下甜甜圈大獎呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "好了，守城人小姐，沒有別的事的話，我就先回去交差了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "正好，有這個洞，我也省得繞遠路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "嗯？……等等，這條路好像通往那個地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "天啊，沒想到我今天還真的能趕上，我本來以為絕對沒機會了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被銬住的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "哇——好痛！請慢點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "什麼地方啊，那麼神祕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "安比爾！！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "又有什麼事啊，隊長？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "我以為在我打來之前，你已經想好怎麼解釋牆上的大洞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "沒有人違反規定喔，我真的有好好堅守崗位的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "……少跟我耍花招！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "text": "從現在開始，你的工作多了一項——看好那個洞，不准讓任何人通過！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一座斜陽裡的城市。\n將兩個雪糕筒路障擺放在圍牆上的洞前，守城人忽然感受到一道目光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "好無聊啊，隊長。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "你就算要監督我，也沒必要藏起來吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那道身影躲在樹後，小心地探出了頭，卻正好對上守城人的目光，馬上又把臉藏了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……是個孩子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "……別、別過來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "我記得，現在應該還沒到放學時間吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "勸你乖乖回到教室，我會當作沒看到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "也……也先別走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "請待在原地就好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "我……我只是想看看你的銃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "我的銃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……看你的樣子，好像是快要到選擇守護銃的年紀了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "來，這下子能看得更清楚了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "怎樣，讓你失望了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "為、為什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "為什麼……你的守護銃和聖徒像的守護銃長得那麼像？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "這個嘛……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "孩子，還沒選好你的守護銃嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "工坊裡的存貨都給你看過了，如果你全都不喜歡，或許……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的安比爾",
      "text": "我要這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "哪個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "……你是指聖徒像拿著的那把長銃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "但那是雕塑上的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "……我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "那把銃是過去的經典款式，我應該還能找到拆解圖。現做一把得花點時間，過幾天你來拿就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的安比爾",
      "text": "多謝你，工匠先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "這不算什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械工坊工匠",
      "text": "倒是像你一樣以聖徒為榜樣的孩子，現在已經很少見囉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "我選擇它做守護銃……沒什麼特別的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "它很輕，射程也足夠遠，僅此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "射程足夠遠？但我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "沒關係。使用它，不需要特別高超的射擊天賦，也不需要什麼偉大的志向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "它就是一把銃，你當然也可以選擇一模一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "只要你想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "不……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "……對不起，你可能誤會了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "書上說聖徒的子彈就是律法降下的懲罰，被打中的話特別特別痛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "我只是想確認一下，要是我偷偷穿過這個洞，這把聖徒的銃，應該不會向我開火吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "目送翹課的孩子返回學校之後，守城人行過街角。\n晚鐘還未敲響，街上只有零星的幾個行人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "兩個巧克力冰淇淋球，再加點可可碎片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……今天這裡好冷清啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "嗯……可能是因為帕尼拉大街那邊的甜品店正在舉行限時活動吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "限時活動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "是啊，據說在賣特別限定版巧克力黃昏慕斯，只有今天一天，而且活動到五點半就截止了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "特別限定版巧克力黃昏慕斯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "五點半就結束……好多人還沒有下班、沒有放學呢，不是都趕不上了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "對啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "有些人啊，就算是請假也一定要去買，我這裡可競爭不過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "怪不得……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "來，拿好您的冰淇淋，謝謝惠顧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守城人一轉頭，忽然看見一旁的下水井蓋正在詭異地跳動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂，喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有人在嗎？誰能來幫幫我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "來，抓住它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的老人",
      "text": "哎喲，總算得救了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的老人",
      "text": "嗯？把我從下水道裡拉上來的這把長銃……我好像在哪裡見過……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……老師？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的老人",
      "text": "……原來是安比爾，好久不見啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "真好，看起來你已經成長為一名出色的守城人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "你為什麼會在下水道裡……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "啊哈哈，我是在和我的守護銃交流啊，就像我以前教你的那樣，不記得了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……是說在禁閉室的那次嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外面的聲音",
      "text": "我爸爸做了超甜奶油蛋糕！誰想吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外面的聲音",
      "text": "還有還有，這是我家店裡做的蜂蜜瘤奶昔，誰要喝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外面的聲音",
      "text": "喂！你做什麼？快把我的巧克力還給我！還給我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被關禁閉的學生",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被關禁閉的學生",
      "text": "我被關了多久了？好餓……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被關禁閉的學生",
      "text": "只要踩在椅子上，我就能從高窗翻出去……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學校老師",
      "text": "很好，看來你的確有學到什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被關禁閉的學生",
      "text": "……老師？我不是想要……我下次不會再……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學校老師",
      "text": "我明白。禁閉室能關住你的人，但是並不能關住你的心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學校老師",
      "text": "你用銃打碎了高窗的玻璃，這就是你和銃械交流的結果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被關禁閉的學生",
      "text": "我明知道這違反了學校的規定，但我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學校老師",
      "text": "……沒關係的，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學校老師",
      "text": "銃械之所以重要，就是因為它能讓你正視自己的內心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學校老師",
      "text": "拉特蘭也因此才能變得越來越好，成為守護人們心之所向的樂園。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被關禁閉的學生",
      "text": "心之所向……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學校老師",
      "text": "告訴我，安比爾，你現在最想要什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被關禁閉的學生",
      "text": "我……我想要……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被關禁閉的學生",
      "text": "我想要……巧克力……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "對，對，沒錯！你該不會是還在記恨我關你禁閉吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "不過，看到你手上的巧克力冰淇淋，我就知道你並沒有遺忘我的教誨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……被你這麼說，我有點不想吃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "所以，老師又是因為什麼樣的心之所向，才鑽進了下水道裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "不去管學生們，偷偷跑出來，真的沒問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "哈哈，你看，這是我的守護銃。剛剛我握著它在學校的禱告廳祈禱，忽然感受到一股強烈的呼喚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "順著它的指引，我發現禱告廳地下竟有一個神祕通道。走到盡頭，我就看到頭頂有光亮……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "我本來以為我將見證奇蹟，結果……你也看到了，我卡在了這個下水道口動彈不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "說得那麼玄之又玄的，老師其實就是想翹班吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "不，我想我的守護銃想要的更簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "它一定只是想看看，拉特蘭今天的夕陽吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "順便……要是能趕上今天的甜品店限時活動就更好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……果然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "這個理由可不足以讓你逃脫罰責喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "涉嫌破壞下水管線，擾亂正常通行秩序，以及在非開放時間翻越圍牆，雖然是從地下……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "好啦安比爾，之後我會主動去公證所領罰的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "但要是錯過了限定版甜品，還錯過了聖城一天中最輝煌的時分，那就太可惜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在此時，戍衛隊的新兵們在街對面列隊行過。\n金色的夕照落在他們的銃上，落在他們的帽檐上，落在他們稚嫩卻莊嚴的面容上。\n就像流淌在瘤奶吐司上的楓糖漿，也像傾倒在格子鬆餅上的蜂蜜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "夕陽……是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "夕陽總會平等地灑在聖城的每個角落，這堵圍牆可攔不住它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守城人舉起長銃，瞄準遠方鐘樓的頂端，深呼吸——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "街上的行人抬起頭來，樓宇裡的居民望向窗外，街區中的所有拉特蘭人幾乎在同一時刻屏息——\n鐘聲鳴響，幾隻羽獸披著霞光，徐徐飛過晴空。\n短暫的沉默後，歡聲笑語帶著人們的心之所向，從街區的各個角落紛至沓來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "45分19秒。比預定的鐘聲響起時間早了45分19秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "本街區的下班時間也將提早45分19秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "他們可以早點走出房間，與朋友們交談去哪裡度過愉快的夜晚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "更重要的是，大家都不會錯過如此美好的夕陽，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "安比爾，你是為了讓大家都趕上甜品店的限時活動吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……哈哈，還有十多分鐘，我反正肯定能趕上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "老師，我可以和你一起去嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "不接？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "不接，我下班了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "……還真是亂來啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "奇怪，今天的鐘聲是不是響得太早了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "過路的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "哇！夕陽真好看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "我有一個提議，以後每年的這一天，我們都早一個小時下班吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "過路的拉特蘭人",
      "text": "我同意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守城人看見霞雲後的落日露出頭來，聖城在天空中的倒影也向她眨了眨眼。\n不覺間，街上已經人來人往。在拉特蘭平凡的一天中，到處洋溢著自由與歡笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "這才是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比爾",
      "text": "……拉特蘭的榮耀啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
